{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf","id":876347,"title":"EXALTED RETURNS - The Solar \"Backer Charm\" PDF","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-28T01:18:31-07:00","id":876347,"title":"EXALTED RETURNS - The Solar \"Backer Charm\" PDF","content":"Greetings all ye Chosen!<br /> <br /> Now that the awesome hardcover is starting to ship I just wanted to drop in and remind you of more good news. The Solar &quot;Backer Charm&quot; book is headed your way in the near future. This book was written as the result of a stretch goal we reached during the Kickstarter. It features 48 brand new Solar Charms that were purchased by our awesome backers. <br /> <br /> For this special book we focused on writing Charms that were very, very, V-E-R-Y powerful. We're talking power level turned up until the pages hum and crackle with Essence. We made it our mission to write Charms that would magnify the legendary badassdom of the Solar Exalted, letting you stand out and shine even brighter in your selected purview. Now you truly can burn like the sun, all thanks to our glorious Kickstarter backers! <br /> <br /> ALSO as a BONUS we wrote <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>33</b> </span><b>additional Solar Charms</b> as a BIG thank you for all the incredible support and enthusiasm you've shown for what we're doing. <br /> <br /> This book WILL be going on sale\u2014soon! Art assets are being completed.<br /> <br /> Solar players should consider these new Solar Charms a must-have for expanded play. These new pinnacle Charms are just too good to pass up. Get your Supernals ready!<br /> <br /> The Solar Backer Charm PDF is coming soon!<br /> <br /> As the tale of Exalted continues...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":40}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/86-john-m\u00f8rke","name":"John M\u00f8rke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar86_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T01:32:15-07:00","id":876356,"title":"","content":"Wow, that's a LOT of charms. Like, a lot. Like four times what I was expecting at least. Nice job!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T01:34:43-07:00","id":876359,"title":"","content":"MOAR EXALTED<br /> <br /> MOAR","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T01:51:55-07:00","id":876366,"title":"","content":"Okay, I'm going to preface this with a couple things. One: I know that in light of the craziness of getting the core together and printed, I <b>super</b> appreciate that you guys got right back into things to write these additional charms.<br /> <br /> In addition, I appreciate the extra work that no doubt went into them.<br /> <br /> In light of my sincere appreciation for this, I would also like to preface: The following line is meant as a joke -<br /> <br /> Oh Gods and Maidens, <b>MORE CHARMS?!</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T01:55:38-07:00","id":876367,"title":"","content":"So... non backers can get in on this too, right? If so, I'm very excited and wish I had more money to give right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some Tunes for your Exalted Game? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1071249-exalted-tunes\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-exalted-tunes</a><br /> Want some help managing your PCs? <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/882498-new-anathema-character-management-anathema-reincarnated\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...a-reincarnated</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2442-arian-dynas","name":"Arian Dynas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T01:58:57-07:00","id":876369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876366#post876366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh Gods and Maidens, <b>MORE CHARMS?!</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Not only that, but even more, even crazier powerful ones!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:01:54-07:00","id":876372,"title":"","content":"Any hints on the Ability distribution of the new Charms? I'd really love to see more high Essence Charms in Medicine and War, to name two. <br /> <br /> Honestly I'm a bit wary of this super-Charm pitch because of the power creep of the popular Charm sets like Melee and Brawl in 2e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:03:35-07:00","id":876373,"title":"","content":"Power sprint?<br /> <br /> How can it be &quot;creep&quot; if it happens so quickly?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:09:28-07:00","id":876377,"title":"","content":"Starting your pitch with MOAR POWERFUL CHARMS may not be the best idea. It's giving me really bad Glories/Zeal/etc flashbacks. Heck, I've already seen someone, upon reading that post, almost declare all charms from it banned for power reasons.<br /> Is the main selling point you want to stress really &quot;Solar charms, except even more powerful&quot; instead of something like &quot;flesh out and give capstones to smaller trees&quot; or something?<br /> Still, I remain hopeful that it turns out better than my initial impression.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Some of me humble homebrew for ex3:<br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hOOjEGyoq3owLoUwIwTfWKTffzo_udsiUTwomw7wudA/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Artifacts for Crumple's DB homebrew</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tI2T1Re0G8QOuoXkH7Y4PrKQxk1BPEGpbi82SpkTyIw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Some Lintha QCs</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O2I_2iWTCflJ36ggkDvjTeXmzFsGHKRxAi6L_Ry6g4w/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A Wyld Behemoth</a></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8838-tds","name":"TDS","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:15:43-07:00","id":876381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876367#post876367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... non backers can get in on this too, right? If so, I'm very excited and wish I had more money to give right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given that it's a reward for backers and the post says it will be available for <i>sale</i>, I assume they will be selling it through DTRPG like a regular product.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:16:59-07:00","id":876383,"title":"","content":"Amusingly, if Morke had said &quot;Also: Crafting Charms for things other than artifacts!&quot; I would have gone &quot;So is this included in my initial backing or do you take Paypal?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:20:40-07:00","id":876389,"title":"","content":"MOAR CHARMS!!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Couple of questions though, will this pdf have all the core book charms as well?<br /> Or will you have the charms trees in this pdf to show thier relation to the core charms?<br /> I'm more then sure that these charms will be fun so not really worried about that, more interested in the layout haha, thank you for the continued efforts you and the rest of the team keep putting into this project ^_^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9182-orannius","name":"Orannius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:21:41-07:00","id":876391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876367#post876367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... non backers can get in on this too, right? If so, I'm very excited and wish I had more money to give right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Backers with the approrpiate reward tier have been able to submit Charm ideas, and I think some backer reward tier have the final product included as well. Otherwise, it can be purchased off DriveThruRPG like any other supplement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:28:35-07:00","id":876397,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876377#post876377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Starting your pitch with MOAR POWERFUL CHARMS may not be the best idea. It's giving me really bad Glories/Zeal/etc flashbacks. Heck, I've already seen someone, upon reading that post, almost declare all charms from it banned for power reasons.<br /> Is the main selling point you want to stress really &quot;Solar charms, except even more powerful&quot; instead of something like &quot;flesh out and give capstones to smaller trees&quot; or something?<br /> Still, I remain hopeful that it turns out better than my initial impression.</div> </div> </div> </div>They were written for backers, not to 'flesh out' charm trees. They're from backer requests, plus extra stuff for funsies, not out of some sense that they needed to be written. If you don't want the charms then you don't have to use them, power level or effect or personal choice, all those things are valid. <br /> <br /> If someone wants to houserule a ban because they haven't read them yet but don't like the pitch, well, okay they can totally do that. Seems a little bit over-reactive to me, and certainly not something I'd be wanting to admit to the Devs and writers...<br /> <br /> (personal anecdote: John's mood while working on these was pretty fucking glorious mostly, and they're so much fun dangit) (so fun, my god)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">. ... for me, the transformative power of art is you are </span></span></span><i>not </i><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">above the material.&quot; -= Guillermo del Toro</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":21}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9752-lucy-darling","name":"Lucy Darling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9752_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:35:10-07:00","id":876401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876397#post876397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(personal anecdote: John's mood while working on these was pretty fucking glorious mostly, and they're so much fun dangit) (so fun, my god)</div> </div> </div> </div>That actually does make me feel a bit better, thanks Lucy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:47:00-07:00","id":876406,"title":"","content":"Ooh, will be good to see which of my ideas made it into the document! Yay for more products.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:49:52-07:00","id":876408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf#post876347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Greetings all ye Chosen!<br /> <br /> Now that the awesome hardcover is starting to ship I just wanted to drop in and remind you of more good news. The Solar &quot;Backer Charm&quot; book is headed your way in the near future. This book was written as the result of a stretch goal we reached during the Kickstarter. It features 48 brand new Solar Charms that were purchased by our awesome backers.<br /> <br /> For this special book we focused on writing Charms that were very, very, V-E-R-Y powerful. We're talking power level turned up until the pages hum and crackle with Essence. We made it our mission to write Charms that would magnify the legendary badassdom of the Solar Exalted, letting you stand out and shine even brighter in your selected purview. Now you truly can burn like the sun, all thanks to our glorious Kickstarter backers!<br /> <br /> ALSO as a BONUS we wrote <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>33</b> </span><b>additional Solar Charms</b> as a BIG thank you for all the incredible support and enthusiasm you've shown for what we're doing.<br /> <br /> This book WILL be going on sale\u2014soon! Art assets are being completed.<br /> <br /> Solar players should consider these new Solar Charms a must-have for expanded play. These new pinnacle Charms are just too good to pass up. Get your Supernals ready!<br /> <br /> The Solar Backer Charm PDF is coming soon!<br /> <br /> As the tale of Exalted continues...</div> </div> </div> </div>On the one hand, yay backer Charms.<br /> <br /> On the other hand... Power concerns aside, given that charm bloat was already understood to be a problem in 2e back when the Solar charmset was just over a third the size of the current one, I am mystified why you seem to consider Even Moar Charms to be a <i>good</i> thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are no problems, only plothooks.<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P2AuLM6D1Et9mWQVJp-ugWujFJhTi2VwQBtOazOW1Mg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Terrifying Argent Witches Hub</a><br /> <i>Originally posted by </i><b><i>Dex Davican</i></b><br /> I need them for my collection: <i>Enormous Gonads of 2012: A Retrospective.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/920-imrix","name":"Imrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T02:55:17-07:00","id":876411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arian Dynas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876367#post876367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... non backers can get in on this too, right?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes indeed!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/86-john-m\u00f8rke","name":"John M\u00f8rke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar86_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:00:49-07:00","id":876414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Imrix</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am mystified why you seem to consider Even Moar Charms to be a good thing</div> </div> </div> </div> Are you never going to homebrew up your own fun, custom Charms in order to cover a method or image space that you consider fitting for Solars (or have otherwise had inspired by some appropriate fiction), and not really part of the current selection? Between John and Lucy and the fact that this thing was ordered by Backers of a certain level, it sounds a lot more like that than anything. What were they supposed to do; come back to those Backers and say &quot;sorry about your money and your enthusiasm, but it turns out that there are too many Charms, so your fun ideas have to be dropped from their self-contained supplement&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:01:43-07:00","id":876416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Imrix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876408#post876408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the other hand... Power concerns aside, given that charm bloat was already understood to be a problem in 2e back when the Solar charmset was just over a third the size of the current one, I am mystified why you seem to consider Even Moar Charms to be a <i>good</i> thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given charm bloat was understood to be a problem in 2e, why did evocations get added to the game? I have no idea, but I'm glad they were because I love them and think they add something really good. I can only assume that if the developers have added more charms, they think it adds to the game, rather than makes things worse... why would they do something that they think detracts from the game? Lets wait and see what they are like before we pass commentary on them or decide if they are going to be used in their game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:03:25-07:00","id":876417,"title":"","content":"Eh, my joke aside, I'm going to at least see what these charms ARE before I make a statement about allowing them in my games or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:05:22-07:00","id":876418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Imrix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876408#post876408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the one hand, yay backer Charms.<br /> <br /> On the other hand... Power concerns aside, given that charm bloat was already understood to be a problem in 2e back when the Solar charmset was just over a third the size of the current one, I am mystified why you seem to consider Even Moar Charms to be a <i>good</i> thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, he was the one who was in charge of making the 3e Solar Charmset as big as it is, so that might have something to do with it. :P<br /> <br /> Also, I'd be surprised if he wasn't excited about his own work. If he wasn't, it's likely we would not see it at all.<br /> <br /> I'm not a huge fan of a super big Charm set, but the backer Charms are rewards which were promised and 33 additional Charms isn't that much spread over 25 Abilities. It sounds like it'll be a neat little supplement, and something to tide us over until the Realm and the Terrestrial books, which I personally consider the most important ones in the line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:05:32-07:00","id":876419,"title":"","content":"How many Craft charms are we looking at here?<br /> <br /> 20? 30?<br /> <br /> I'm just saying, we need more Craft charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:10:35-07:00","id":876420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Imrix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876408#post876408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the one hand, yay backer Charms.<br /> <br /> On the other hand... Power concerns aside, given that charm bloat was already understood to be a problem in 2e back when the Solar charmset was just over a third the size of the current one, I am mystified why you seem to consider Even Moar Charms to be a <i>good</i> thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Charm bloat&quot; in 2e was not really about there being too manyCharms. Charm bloat was the perverse way in which, from a relatively small corebook, the Charmset of certain splats grew by addition after addition in every single supplement, inducing a constant power creep to mechanics that weren't stable to begin with. In the end, the power-set of Exalts was scattered around a dozen different books that veered wildly in nature, theme and power from their original basis, taking the game in bizarre directions and forcing you to constantly cross-reference everything. That was bloat. &quot;Having a lot of Charms&quot; is not bloat, and it's not inherently bad. Neither is &quot;adding new Charms,&quot; depending on how you handle it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:36:19-07:00","id":876430,"title":"","content":"And, like any other sneak peek or preview, over-wrought claims about what it means mechanically for the whole system (I'm looking at you, thread about one spoiler for DB mechanics ending in sky-is-falling houseruling and the wailing of 'brooooooooken') are premature. Wait til you see the thing before you start in on the 'power creep' and so on, hey? Please? For the sake of keeping some semblance of joy about the damn thing?<br /> <br /> Because it can't be much fun, for backers or Devs, to have <i>you've ruined everything!?!?!? </i>aimed at them for a: a kickstarter reward that was always going to happen and b: a bonus extra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">. ... for me, the transformative power of art is you are </span></span></span><i>not </i><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">above the material.&quot; -= Guillermo del Toro</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":24}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9752-lucy-darling","name":"Lucy Darling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9752_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:43:56-07:00","id":876435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876430#post876430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And, like any other sneak peek or preview, over-wrought claims about what it means mechanically for the whole system (I'm looking at you, thread about one spoiler for DB mechanics ending in sky-is-falling houseruling and the wailing of 'brooooooooken') are premature. Wait til you see the thing before you start in on the 'power creep' and so on, hey? Please? For the sake of keeping some semblance of joy about the damn thing?<br /> <br /> Because it can't be much fun, for backers or Devs, to have <i>you've ruined everything!?!?!? </i>aimed at them for a: a kickstarter reward that was always going to happen and b: a bonus extra.</div> </div> </div> </div>We got that when Rich gave people discounted shirts. I'm used to it, honestly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":29}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:46:26-07:00","id":876441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876377#post876377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Starting your pitch with MOAR POWERFUL CHARMS may not be the best idea. It's giving me really bad Glories/Zeal/etc flashbacks. Heck, I've already seen someone, upon reading that post, almost declare all charms from it banned for power reasons.<br /> Is the main selling point you want to stress really &quot;Solar charms, except even more powerful&quot; instead of something like &quot;flesh out and give capstones to smaller trees&quot; or something?<br /> Still, I remain hopeful that it turns out better than my initial impression.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not this tired old tirade again.<br /> <br /> More content and more options is always good in my book - Just don't use it if you don't like it, and don't shoehorn your notions onto other players please.<br /> <br /> I never really played a world-breakingly high-level campaign (and don't know that I want to) and I recognize high-level Charm has a much higher chance of &quot;breaking the game&quot;, but some people enjoyed the high-level weirdness that came out of the older editions as well (and I do enjoy reading that stuff, even if I might not be using it in any of my games).<br /> <br /> To each their own.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/376-solfi","name":"Solfi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:56:37-07:00","id":876449,"title":"","content":"Yay!<br /> <br /> Looking forward to it, though now I have to expand all my Charm Cascades!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T03:57:58-07:00","id":876450,"title":"","content":"Solar power defines Exalted. We're not done with them\u2014not nearly! We will revisit them eventually. The core book and the backer PDF is not the end, just the beginning.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":28}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/86-john-m\u00f8rke","name":"John M\u00f8rke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar86_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:00:11-07:00","id":876453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876411#post876411\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes indeed!</div> </div> </div> </div>I've repeated that charm name so often that I don't even know which splat it belonged to, even less what it does, but...<br /> <br /> WANT BECOMES NEED!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Silencing Whisper, <i>Eclipse</i>; Amethyst, <i>Changing Moon</i>;<br /> Daughter of Charcoal and Ash, <i>Dusk</i>, and her <i>Full Moon </i>sister;<br /> Broken Crystal, <i>Infernal </i>(<i>Night</i>-, or maybe <i>Twilight</i>-equivalent).","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7262-amakawa-yuuto","name":"Amakawa Yuuto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7262_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:03:52-07:00","id":876454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amakawa Yuuto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876453#post876453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've repeated that charm name so often that I don't even know which splat it belonged to, even less what it does, but...<br /> <br /> WANT BECOMES NEED!</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds Sidereal to me.<br /> <br /> Edit: Nope, it's an Ebon Dragon Charm from Ink Monkeys. It's an expansion of Golden Years Tarnished Black. Turns out it creates a positive Intimacy of addicition towards the subject of a memory. At E3+, it causes the target to constantly be in a partially controlled version of the Overindulgeance Limit Break for that specific subject.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 04-28-2016, 07:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:03:59-07:00","id":876455,"title":"","content":"Oh, nice and shiny! I'm glad these charms arent't in the corebook. I already have a problem finding a good place to stash the mighty tome without it getting damaged (or my shelf... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />).<br /> <br /> Good God, just realized, I get the Deluxe edition too, later, my poor shelf. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/47-lc1984","name":"LC1984","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar47_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:06:17-07:00","id":876456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876430#post876430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And, like any other sneak peek or preview, over-wrought claims about what it means mechanically for the whole system (I'm looking at you, thread about one spoiler for DB mechanics ending in sky-is-falling houseruling and the wailing of 'brooooooooken') are premature. Wait til you see the thing before you start in on the 'power creep' and so on, hey? Please? For the sake of keeping some semblance of joy about the damn thing?</div> </div> </div> </div>And that time when they revealed a couple Socialize Charms in the early days of the Weekly Updates, and people started bitching and complaining about how weak the Charms were.<br /> <br /> I call that particular event the &quot;Why We Can't Have Nice Things&quot; thread in my mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:07:10-07:00","id":876457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876450#post876450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Solar power defines Exalted. We're not done with them\u2014not nearly! We will revisit them eventually. The core book and the backer PDF is not the end, just the beginning.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can we have a taste?<br /> <br /> A preview charm maybe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":296,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","user":"hippokrene","date":". 04-28-2016, 07:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:08:00-07:00","id":876458,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876457#post876457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A preview charm maybe?</div> </div> </div> </div>Historically this has gone poorly.<br /> <br /> That said, yes please.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:12:13-07:00","id":876461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876414#post876414\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Are you never going to homebrew up your own fun, custom Charms in order to cover a method or image space that you consider fitting for Solars (or have otherwise had inspired by some appropriate fiction), and not really part of the current selection? Between John and Lucy and the fact that this thing was ordered by Backers of a certain level, it sounds a lot more like that than anything. What were they supposed to do; come back to those Backers and say &quot;sorry about your money and your enthusiasm, but it turns out that there are too many Charms, so your fun ideas have to be dropped from their self-contained supplement&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, and the backer charms are a definite yay. The 33 extra I'm not so sure about.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876420#post876420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Charm bloat&quot; in 2e was not really about there being too many Charms. Charm bloat was the perverse way in which, from a relatively small corebook, the Charmset of certain splats grew by addition after addition in every single supplement, inducing a constant power creep to mechanics that weren't stable to begin with. In the end, the power-set of Exalts was scattered around a dozen different books that veered wildly in nature, theme and power from their original basis, taking the game in bizarre directions and forcing you to constantly cross-reference everything. That was bloat. &quot;Having a lot of Charms&quot; is not bloat, and it's not inherently bad. Neither is &quot;adding new Charms,&quot; depending on how you handle it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that was a big part of it, yeah, but 'too many Charms' was and is absolutely a problem and a form of Charm bloat as well. On the development end it means there's a wider array of effect-packages to consider when balancing anything new, and on the player side it increases the buy-in price of time and effort needed to read and understand the rules before you can start playing.<br /> <br /> Exalted has always been a game that asks a lot of that; the 2e corebook wasn't a small volume by RPG standards. The D&amp;D players handbook, with its general rules, spell lists and multiple class progressions, has never topped 320 pages. The Big Three of the World of Darkness/Chronicles of Darkness, Vampire, Mage and Werewolf, are 312/294, 309/400 and 309/317. The Shadowrun 20th anniversary core is 368 pages. The 2e corebook was 403 pages, and the single biggest section was an 82-page Charms chapter even <i>before</i> the various additions from Glory to the Most High, Ink Monkeys, errata, Dreams of the First Age... And then 3e blows that out of the water with a 176 page Charms chapter, plus about another 40 for Martial Arts. There are <i>rulebooks</i> smaller than that, so, yeah, I call it a problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are no problems, only plothooks.<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P2AuLM6D1Et9mWQVJp-ugWujFJhTi2VwQBtOazOW1Mg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Terrifying Argent Witches Hub</a><br /> <i>Originally posted by </i><b><i>Dex Davican</i></b><br /> I need them for my collection: <i>Enormous Gonads of 2012: A Retrospective.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/920-imrix","name":"Imrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:12:53-07:00","id":876462,"title":"","content":"I don't want to exaggerate, but I can say with absolute certainty that there's no way a charm preview could go poorly for some values of poorly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:25:31-07:00","id":876468,"title":"","content":"I'd love a preview as well.<br /> <br /> Also, very happy to hear that Solars will be revisited at a later date!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T04:45:28-07:00","id":876480,"title":"","content":"I'll talk to Rich about putting a Charm preview into a KS update. Thanks for the support, all!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":24}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/86-john-m\u00f8rke","name":"John M\u00f8rke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar86_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T05:04:49-07:00","id":876491,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the update, John, and thanks for giving us bonus material.<br /> <br /> Can we <b>not</b> poo-poo the developers simply wanting to give us stuff? We didn't know the wider community would have the opportunity to buy the backer charms (I'm sure most of us suspected it would happen), and we weren't promised more charms so soon. All this is good news. Didn't all y'all's parents teach you to say thank you?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":21}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T05:22:39-07:00","id":876502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876430#post876430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm looking at you, <b>thread</b> about one spoiler for DB mechanics ending in sky-is-falling\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>This implies there was only one of them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T05:29:01-07:00","id":876506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solfi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876441#post876441\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To each their own.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>What is this blasphemy!?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/651-throne","name":"Throne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar651_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T05:33:20-07:00","id":876508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Totentanz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876491#post876491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can we <b>not</b> poo-poo the developers simply wanting to give us stuff?</div> </div> </div> </div>Holy shit, please, <b>exactly this.</b><br /> <br /> It would be amazing if, for once, we could not turn into a hazy ball of anger about something like this, were the devs add in a bunch of work for free. Please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":17}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T05:41:40-07:00","id":876514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Totentanz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876491#post876491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the update, John\u2026<br /> Didn't all y'all's parents teach you to say thank you?</div> </div> </div> </div>Whoops! Where <i>are</i> my manners? Thanks, Mr. M\u00f8rke! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T05:42:19-07:00","id":876515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MadLetter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876508#post876508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would be amazing if, for once, we could not turn into a hazy ball of anger about something like this, were the devs add in a bunch of work for free. Please.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apart from how they're selling another book for new players to buy.<br /> <br /> I look forward to seeing the new charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T05:49:47-07:00","id":876527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876515#post876515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apart from how they're selling another book for new players to buy.<br /> <br /> I look forward to seeing the new charms.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> They would have been selling the book regardless of whether or not it had the bonus content. It's also more charms that I was expecting, the stretch goal for for 20 of us to get ONE custom charm. So it's 28 more backer charms, and 33 extra charms above whan was expected...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:01:36-07:00","id":876543,"title":"","content":"More powerful charms is fine, because people were already complaining that some trees didn't have any Essence 4 or 5 charms. I mean, I doubt they'll have Essence 6 charms.<br /> <br /> I'm interested to see what wacky ideas the backers had.<br /> <br /> If they turn out to be too crazy, they're together in one convenient book to not buy and not use. But I imagine they'll be fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:09:34-07:00","id":876548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876543#post876543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More powerful charms is fine, because people were already complaining that some trees didn't have any Essence 4 or 5 charms. I mean, I doubt they'll have Essence 6 charms.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do hope that a good chunk of these charms actually are in underdeveloped abilities (like War), or elaborating on underdeveloped concepts (non-ninja Thrown, social influence through Art/Cooking). I'm somewhat positive that at least *some* of them will be in these abilities and/or touching on these (or at least other new) concepts.<br /> <br /> I'm confident that it's not just 81 more Melee charms... but that would be the worst-case scenario.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Silencing Whisper, <i>Eclipse</i>; Amethyst, <i>Changing Moon</i>;<br /> Daughter of Charcoal and Ash, <i>Dusk</i>, and her <i>Full Moon </i>sister;<br /> Broken Crystal, <i>Infernal </i>(<i>Night</i>-, or maybe <i>Twilight</i>-equivalent).","edited":{"userid":7262,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7262-amakawa-yuuto","user":"Amakawa Yuuto","date":". 04-28-2016, 09:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7262-amakawa-yuuto","name":"Amakawa Yuuto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7262_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:09:49-07:00","id":876549,"title":"","content":"Well...<br /> <br /> This will be interesting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm... not enthusiastic for more charms down the line. I disliked crossreferencing stuff in late 2E, and I don't want that problem to return or for the devs to do the D&amp;D thing and stick charms in unrelated books for pagecount. That said? I'm down for this. Some nice high power unique effects would really round out the 3E Solar charm list. Then again, there's no way to know what sort of stuff we're getting beyond that designator... wait and see I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4086-croakamancer","name":"Croakamancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4086_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:19:57-07:00","id":876555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amakawa Yuuto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876548#post876548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do hope that a good chunk of these charms actually are in underdeveloped abilities (like War), or elaborating on underdeveloped concepts (non-ninja Thrown, social influence through Art/Cooking). I'm somewhat positive that at least *some* of them will be in these abilities and/or touching on these (or at least other new) concepts.<br /> <br /> I'm confident that it's not just 81 more Melee charms... but that would be the worst-case scenario.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Melee got a lot of backer requests, but so did Sail (yes, you read that right: SAIL) and Survival. And we put a few in Abilities that didn't get picked. There's a good spread.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":22}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/86-john-m\u00f8rke","name":"John M\u00f8rke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar86_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:24:06-07:00","id":876562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876555#post876555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Melee got a lot of backer requests, but so did Sail (yes, you read that right: SAIL) and Survival. And we put a few in Abilities that didn't get picked. There's a good spread.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can understand Sail getting a lot (I know one of my ideas was around it), because for me about one third of my games are based in the West, and those games feature a LOT of time on a ship. So being able to do some pretty extreme things with you ship is very desirable. Were a lot of the Survival charms based around familiars?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:25:07-07:00","id":876563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876555#post876555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but so did Sail (yes, you read that right: SAIL)</div> </div> </div> </div>Awwww Yissss. Motha. Fukin' SAIL!<br /> <img src=\"https://d.gr-assets.com/hostedimages/1456205197ra/18202470.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> (I love 3e sail)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\">Bearer of the legacy of Trauma Bear<br /> Need a dice-roller? Check out <a href=\"http://bit.ly/dicemat\" target=\"_blank\">Dicemat</a>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/43-fata-ku","name":"Fata-Ku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar43_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:29:51-07:00","id":876567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Molez</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876562#post876562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Were a lot of the Survival charms based around familiars?</div> </div> </div> </div>ALL <br /> <br /> The backers could not get enough of those effects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/86-john-m\u00f8rke","name":"John M\u00f8rke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar86_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T06:32:06-07:00","id":876569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876555#post876555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Melee got a lot of backer requests, but so did Sail (yes, you read that right: SAIL) and Survival. And we put a few in Abilities that didn't get picked. There's a good spread.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I'm not surprised that there is Melee - &quot;Hitting people with things&quot; is both an effective and classic fighting style in reality and media, and combat is a large part of most RPGs, so I see why it's also the most developed ability. But I'm glad that it's not the only stuff in there.<br /> <br /> (Though I never really cared for Sail. Neither for Ride. Which is ironic, since I'm an Eclipse fanboy. I'm so glad I can select my caste abilities...)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Silencing Whisper, <i>Eclipse</i>; Amethyst, <i>Changing Moon</i>;<br /> Daughter of Charcoal and Ash, <i>Dusk</i>, and her <i>Full Moon </i>sister;<br /> Broken Crystal, <i>Infernal </i>(<i>Night</i>-, or maybe <i>Twilight</i>-equivalent).","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7262-amakawa-yuuto","name":"Amakawa Yuuto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7262_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T07:02:11-07:00","id":876594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TDS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876377#post876377\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Starting your pitch with MOAR POWERFUL CHARMS may not be the best idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>I literally asked for a War charm so goddamn powerful that demons looked at Solars using it and NOPEd out of Creation and back into Malfeas because that was safer for them. I figured if I was going to spend $200 on a custom charm, it would be better to request a charm that delivered something <i>fucking awesome</i> to the community as a whole and that pushed the boundaries of what the corebook offered. <br /> <br /> Sure, it was kind of embarrassing when John indirectly pointed out that I'd completely misread Ideal Battle Knowledge Prana in a really bizarre way that made my request much too powerful to write, but I'm extremely curious about the alternative he suggested. <br /> <br /> (In b4 my e-mails got lost in a vortex of confusion and the devs went with my backup request or something.) <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T07:20:37-07:00","id":876600,"title":"","content":"This is so awesome.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/73-ares","name":"Ares","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar73_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"133"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T07:22:52-07:00","id":876603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876594#post876594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I literally asked for a War charm so goddamn powerful that demons looked at Solars using it and NOPEd out of Creation and back into Malfeas because that was safer for them. I figured if I was going to spend $200 on a custom charm, it would be better to request a charm that delivered something <i>fucking awesome</i> to the community as a whole and that pushed the boundaries of what the corebook offered.</div> </div> </div> </div>I now love you.<br /> <br /> We definitely need a fucking ton of additional War Charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T07:24:07-07:00","id":876605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876567#post876567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ALL<br /> <br /> The backers could not get enough of those effects.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Survival tree was really, really good and evocative. I can totally understand why. The Zenith in one of my games <i>agonized</i> over whether they should take Survival or Resistance as their supernal because they were both such strong choices. <br /> <br /> Seeing you so enthusiastic about getting these new charms out to everyone is, to me, very infectious. I am super excited for the charms and to see you, Holden, and the writers share your enthusiasm about the other upcoming projects as they get close.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Pronounced &quot;Monkey Pie&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/762726-actual-play-the-party-prelude-project\" target=\"_blank\">Find my actual play content here!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/656-monkipi","name":"Monkipi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar656_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"318"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T08:47:43-07:00","id":876671,"title":"","content":"Jesus fucking christ, more charms? Like, I don't want to be a downer here, but they better be <i>really goddamn good</i> in order for me to not immediately dismiss the whole book as more charm bloat. And by good, I don't mean &quot;powerful&quot;, I mean flavorful, evocative, charms that inform me about the abilities of Solars and provide new and interesting unique options for my character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T08:54:19-07:00","id":876679,"title":"","content":"Just to be a dissenting voice;<br /> <br /> MOAR CHARMS PLEASE!<br /> <br /> Seriously. A book the size of the Core full of Charms would be ideal. I don't hold with this new-fangled &quot;Too many charms!&quot; mindset. I remember memorizing every hit table for every weapon against every AC in both MERP and Rolemaster. I then remembered every critical hit one. &quot;32 hits and E Crush critical ... on a 94? You caved his head in! Huzzah!&quot;<br /> <br /> No books used.<br /> <br /> MOAR CHARMS!<br /> <br /> ...and moar coffee. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/907-jay","name":"Jay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T08:58:08-07:00","id":876683,"title":"","content":"*making grabby hands* Want now! Thanks!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876567#post876567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ALL<br /> <br /> The backers could not get enough of those effects.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the game I'm in, the Twilight has a large fire devil (like dust devil) elemental familiar and one Eclipse has a Siaka. We keep joking they should Captain Planet/that fist spell style join to make a flaming Sharknado. I mean there ARE fog sharks already.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":378,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","user":"haren","date":".  Sharknado and thanks 04-28-2016, 12:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T08:59:50-07:00","id":876685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jay</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876679#post876679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just to be a dissenting voice;<br /> <br /> MOAR CHARMS PLEASE!</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not entirely sure you're the dissenting voice so far <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I, for one, would love more Charms. Not so much in abilities that already are pretty decently staffed in that department, but War for example... really needs more love <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/322-madletter","name":"MadLetter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar322_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:00:00-07:00","id":876686,"title":"","content":"I'm excited for these charms, especially because they are explicitly filling the niche many people complained about<b></b>: high essence options.<br /> <br /> The fact that John's mood while writing them was observed as &quot;pretty fucking glorious&quot; just makes me more intrigued to see them.<br /> <br /> I'll be shocked if I ever get a game to last long enough to get to high essence charms, so it's not really any extra legwork for me, but color me excited anyways!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:02:26-07:00","id":876690,"title":"","content":"Looking forward to it! If even a single one is just a dice trick with flavor text I'll groan until my lungs exit my body through my mouth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11216-grindavikur","name":"Grindavikur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11216_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:05:07-07:00","id":876692,"title":"","content":"Does anyone know how many of the charms are actually Backer requests? I don't recall how many were purchased in the KS.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:05:29-07:00","id":876693,"title":"","content":"Not to be that guy, but uh, for sale? I was under the impression that the backer Charms were free content bought with the kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Don't feel bad. People tell the developers they get Exalted wrong all the time. -hippokrene","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4729-childofthesun1","name":"Childofthesun1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4729_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"853"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:07:03-07:00","id":876694,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Childofthesun1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876693#post876693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to be that guy, but uh, for sale? I was under the impression that the backer Charms were free content bought with the kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think the sale is for us non-backer plebs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:07:19-07:00","id":876695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Childofthesun1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876693#post876693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to be that guy, but uh, for sale? I was under the impression that the backer Charms were free content bought with the kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you backed at that tier (the $300, limited to 20 places) you got to request a charm and got a copy of the backer charms.<br /> <br /> Everyone else, regular back or not, was never expected to get a copy of the charms, but it was said it would be for sale later. Far as I can recall that has always been the case (I say this as someone who backed for a custom charm).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:08:17-07:00","id":876697,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Molez</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876695#post876695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> If you backed at that tier (the $300, limited to 20 places) you got to request a charm and got a copy of the backer charms.<br /> <br /> Everyone else, regular back or not, was never expected to get a copy of the charms, but it was said it would be for sale later. Far as I can recall that has always been the case (I say this as someone who backed for a custom charm).</div> </div> </div> </div>I also think that during the KS, you could add some money to your pledge to pre-order it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Pronounced &quot;Monkey Pie&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/762726-actual-play-the-party-prelude-project\" target=\"_blank\">Find my actual play content here!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/656-monkipi","name":"Monkipi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar656_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"318"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:09:25-07:00","id":876702,"title":"","content":"A copy of the backer charms was unlocked for certain reward tiers as a stretch goal I think. If you bought a dead-tree book, I think there's good odds you get a copy of it. Everyone else buys it (though it sounds like it'll probably be what... 25 pages tops?)<br /> <br /> Edit: I take that back, I think I added $5 (or something) as an add-on to get a copy of it during the KS. Monkipi reminded me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:10:06-07:00","id":876706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monkipi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876697#post876697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I also think that during the KS, you could add some money to your pledge to pre-order it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are correct. Checking Kickstarter: <span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">+ $5 for the </span></span></span><b>Custom Charms Compilation PDF</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:10:14-07:00","id":876707,"title":"","content":"Nope, Backer charms were an add-on unless they were included as part of your pledge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:17:44-07:00","id":876713,"title":"","content":"I'm now hoping that I remembered to add it. I think I did, but now I wonder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Pronounced &quot;Monkey Pie&quot;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/762726-actual-play-the-party-prelude-project\" target=\"_blank\">Find my actual play content here!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/656-monkipi","name":"Monkipi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar656_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"318"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:20:37-07:00","id":876718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monkipi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876713#post876713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm now hoping that I remembered to add it. I think I did, but now I wonder.</div> </div> </div> </div>You can check your Exalted 3rd Edition KS backer survey to find out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","