ow'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> WHY DID YOU PUT ESSENCE 6+ STUFF IN THE COREBOOK AAAAA GOD MY LIZARD BRAIN IS ON FIREEEE WHEN DOES THE HURTING STOP etc</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> ...ahem... sorry. Anyways I look forward to these! ESPECIALLY the War charms. War is the best combat ability in EX3. Ya'll are sleeping or are living in the in the past with your associates degree in analytics. You don't even know!<br /> <br /> Anyways that was a strange post but I'm just gonna press POST and let it rock.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Incentive is not permission or justification.","edited":{"userid":255,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/255-paranoiacombo","user":"ParanoiaCombo","date":". 04-28-2016, 02:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/255-paranoiacombo","name":"ParanoiaCombo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar255_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"526"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T11:24:03-07:00","id":876804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chejop Kejak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-t