e":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":19}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/998-korhal_iv","name":"Korhal_IV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"592"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T21:54:18-07:00","id":877328,"title":"","content":"Sweet`fancy Moses in a sidecar with chocolate jimmies, this is so much sooner than I had anticipated!<br /> <br /> I literally have no idea what my Charm will look like. My first concept was (rightly) ruled too problematic, as it short-circuited the whole &quot;building Intimacies&quot; procedure that Social combat revolves around. I was asking a bunch of &quot;acceptable/non-acceptable?&quot; questions to properly scale my second concept, when Mr. Morke emailed me with &quot;never mind, working on something much closer to original concept.&quot; I was worried that I'd damaged his brain with my inelegant ideas, but now that I hear that his spirits were high while working on the Backer Charm stuff, I can excitedly hop from foot to foot in good conscience, as I wait for the POD to drop.<br /> <br /> <b>Puritan-Demon Cofraternity,</b> I can't wait to see what you look like!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1536-39steps","name":"39Steps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1536_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"255"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T21:56:30-07:00","id":877329,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_po