-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877333#post877333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm honestly not sure what you mean.<br /> <br /> Why would the way he chooses to advertise his work have any effect on his right to post</div> </div> </div> </div>If everything you make isn't the coolest, best thing you've ever made, let someone else sell it for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:20:38-07:00","id":877352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877333#post877333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty sure it's several years too late for that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey, if TalosX is right, and if you added your +$5 dollars to get the backer charms to your purchase, and have no interest in redeeming the download, I'll take it off your hands.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:25:52-07:00","id":877359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877228#post877228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What on earth are you basing that off of? There's pessimism and then there's whatever this is.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pattern recognition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:42:15-07:00","id":877369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TalosX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877349#post877349\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends, did you specifically add $5 to your KS purchase for the backer charms? If not, then you don't ever have to worry about it.<br /> <br /> After reading about some of the other backers charm ideas, I don't think that many of the backer charms are overpowered. They're just meant for Essence 4 to 5 play.</div> </div> </div> </div>That at least is good news.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure. Maybe not. I'll find out soon enough, I suppose.<br /> <br /> If I did, I'm keeping it. I might be pessimistic, but I'm also curious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:42:58-07:00","id":877370,"title":"","content":"Hell yeah. Thanks to the devs and freelancers for putting in the extra work!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10291-zeesun","name":"Zeesun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"252"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:46:38-07:00","id":877372,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877232#post877232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The general tone doesn't help much either. Usually when I see someone talking about their work that way, the work turns out to be really bad.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now I'm totally bewildered as to what an appropriate tone would be. Like, legit confused here.<br /> <br /> Too positive! Too mean! Ego! Not enough communication! Something something TONE! Like, honestly, what are we meant to do?<br /> <br /> Well, not me, obvs. I am a paragon of virtue and delight and no-one ever misunderstands my words.<br /> <br /> (Lucy looks at the pile of redlines right next to her right at this moment)<br /> <br /> <i>Delightful and understandable I tell you</i>.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">. ... for me, the transformative power of art is you are </span></span></span><i>not </i><span style=\"color:#5C5C5C\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">above the material.&quot; -= Guillermo del Toro</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":28}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9752-lucy-darling","name":"Lucy Darling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9752_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:54:22-07:00","id":877375,"title":"","content":"Personally, if this option is offered again, I'd like a bit more in the way of communication, feedback, and more than two passes if there is a problem. I grant that probably wasn't feasible this time around, but I still remain confused at to why some of my charm suggestions weren't allowed.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:54:31-07:00","id":877376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877372#post877372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, not me, obvs. I am a paragon of virtue and delight and no-one ever misunderstands my words.<br /> <br /> (Lucy looks at the pile of redlines right next to her right at this moment)<br /> <br /> <i>Delightful and understandable I tell you</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Delightful Understanding Prana: what <i>isn't </i>it good for?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10291-zeesun","name":"Zeesun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"252"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T22:56:07-07:00","id":877377,"title":"","content":"The Kickstarter pitch from 2013 was quite good. It was enthusiastic, but not in a way that led to me getting into fights with people who think it's alright to mock John (and others) for writing so badly.<br /> <br /> If you want a more recent example, everything I've seen from Sine Nomine regarding the production of Godbound has been good.<br /> <br /> And I actually don't recall having any problem with you or the way you communicate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T23:55:43-07:00","id":877407,"title":"","content":"If talking about the press release is a thing that is happening I wouldn't say that's too enthusiastic as such. It *does* read a bit more like a advert from an early '90s toy company selling the hyped up hot new action figure to tweens. Less than a positive two way conversation with your enthusiastic and literate adult audience, where you both explain things and get something out of it.<br /> <br /> (Is any fan entitled to the latter from busy creative people? No. Do I reckon it's the ideal for most? Yes).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T01:09:41-07:00","id":877450,"title":"","content":"John: &quot;You want something that's powerful?&quot;<br /> <br /> 90s kids: &quot;Yeah!&quot;<br /> <br /> John: &quot;You want something that's REALLY powerful?&quot;<br /> <br /> 90s kids: &quot;YEAH!&quot;<br /> <br /> John: &quot;Then try new Exalted third edition backer charms! They're crackling with Solar power!&quot; *guitar riff*<br /> <br /> 90s kids: &quot;Awesome! But will our parents get it?&quot;<br /> <br /> John: &quot;No way dudes! It's just too cool!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Seriously though I have no problem with how the backer charms were posted in the OP of this thread, I'm just a tad apprehensive about their...uh...OPness. Don't say that out loud. Incidentally, this is EXACTLY what I was talking about, where a huge part of the community loves it, but a couple people don't, and I feel like in the future people will point to this thread among others and say &quot;See? This is why we can't release anything to the community! Look at all the hate!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T01:25:53-07:00","id":877456,"title":"","content":"Get on my level, Dr. Love Monkey.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/BvMyvwe.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T01:35:42-07:00","id":877461,"title":"","content":"That picture is apt, hippokrene, since my Twilight Chef character has a pet osprey for a familiar. (I had the spare Merit dots and ospreys kick ass)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T01:57:28-07:00","id":877467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"