class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877450#post877450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">John: &quot;You want something that's powerful?&quot;<br /> <br /> 90s kids: &quot;Yeah!&quot;<br /> <br /> John: &quot;You want something that's REALLY powerful?&quot;<br /> <br /> 90s kids: &quot;YEAH!&quot;<br /> <br /> John: &quot;Then try new Exalted third edition backer charms! They're crackling with Solar power!&quot; *guitar riff*<br /> <br /> 90s kids: &quot;Awesome! But will our parents get it?&quot;<br /> <br /> John: &quot;No way dudes! It's just too cool!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Seriously though I have no problem with how the backer charms were posted in the OP of this thread, I'm just a tad apprehensive about their...uh...OPness. Don't say that out loud. Incidentally, this is EXACTLY what I was talking about, where a huge part of the community loves it, but a couple people don't, and I feel like in the future people will point to this thread among others and say &quot;See? This is why we can't release anything to the community! Look at all the hate!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I want to see someone make a video vaguely like &quot;Log from Blamo!&quot; <a href=\"https://youtu.be/RTrAVpK9blw\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/RTrAVpK9blw</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:12:04-07:00","id":877650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877372#post877372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Now I'm totally bewildered as to what an appropriate tone would be. Like, legit confused here.<br /> <br /> Too positive! Too mean! Ego! Not enough communication! Something something TONE! Like, honestly, what are we meant to do?<br /> <br /> Well, not me, obvs. I am a paragon of virtue and delight and no-one ever misunderstands my words.<br /> <br /> (Lucy looks at the pile of redlines right next to her right at this moment)<br /> <br /> <i>Delightful and understandable I tell you</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know how you feel. Every sentence I write is among the most eloquent and moving passages put to page in centuries, yet sadly it's often read by those who can't comprehend its brilliance. It's a hard road.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6601-totentanz","name":"Totentanz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:13:02-07:00","id":877651,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877372#post877372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now I'm totally bewildered as to what an appropriate tone would be. Like, legit confused here.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Hey guys, we've just finished compiling the backer charms. We think these charms fill some important gaps in the charm trees, open up a whole bunch of character concepts, and give some of the lower-count trees a bit more love in the high-essence ranges.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5411-andrewh","name":"AndrewH","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:17:41-07:00","id":877653,"title":"","content":"....or maybe it's a just a great relief for the Devs to actually be able to get stuff out to us now the Cores released... and they're, god-forbid ... Happy and excited!<br /> <br /> I'd rather happy and excited than quiet, not able to reveal things and under pressure trying to defend something people at that point hadn't seen apart from aged leaks....<br /> <br /> Devs - Be as bombastic as you like in your posts and talking up of products. If you aren't getting grief over perceived slights and attitude you're getting grief over enthusiasm, gusto and positivity. Maybe some people will only be happy when you speak to the fanbase through multiple PR gurus, an AI devoid of any emotion and by morse code!?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/907-jay","name":"Jay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:17:55-07:00","id":877655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AndrewH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877651#post877651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Hey guys, we've just finished compiling the backer charms. We think these charms fill some important gaps in the charm trees, open up a whole bunch of character concepts, and give some of the lower-count trees a bit more love in the high-essence ranges.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds so thoroughly <i>mediocre</i>. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":16}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:30:05-07:00","id":877661,"title":"","content":"*shrug* Whatever. She asked what an appropriate tone would be, I gave an example.<br /> <br /> The fact is, hyping something as OMG SO POWERFUL EVERYONE MUST GET THIS! can be counter-productive, especially in a game like Exalted, which has had balance issues in the past. &quot;Power-creep&quot; is not usually considered as a positive.<br /> <br /> Enthusiasm is good. Excitement is good. But putting the emphasis on how POWERFUL new charms are make people who care about balance worried. This shouldn't be a hard concept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5411-andrewh","name":"AndrewH","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:33:40-07:00","id":877664,"title":"","content":"For what it's worth, I'd be shocked if most of the SUGGESTED backer charms from fans weren't fairly powerful in design. I'm not blanketing everyone who did with an accusation, but my impression is that most people want &quot;X really cool big effect&quot; and suggested such. I could be wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:35:23-07:00","id":877665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877372#post877372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now I'm totally bewildered as to what an appropriate tone would be. Like, legit confused here.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was the first one on this thread to express any not-joking reservations so I feel I should respond.<br /> <br /> Maybe this wasn't a problem of tone exactly, it was just that stressing the very (indeed, V-E-R-Y) high powered nature of the new Charms gives me unfortunate flashbacks to the blasted hellscape of 2.5 Solar power bloat that we just escaped for a merciful while.<br /> <br /> I don't think this was an entirely unfounded concern, because the Ink Monkey material by mister M\u00f8rke and others in the current team was a major contributor to said blasted hellscape. I really understand why you are frustrated with the forum response, and I can't speak for anyone else, but it's hard for me not to over-analyse each new drip of information when the drips come so very slowly.<br /> <br /> As for what could have been said instead, stressing that something is <i>fun </i>will get my enthusiasm going better than something being powerful every time.<br /> <br /> I have reasonable expectations that the new Charms will be just fine, but it's difficult to not be tense.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lucy Darling</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=876397#post876397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you don't want the charms then you don't have to use them, power level or effect or personal choice, all those things are valid.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>John M\u00f8rke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf#post876347\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Solar players should consider these new Solar Charms a must-have for expanded play.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's probably <i>some</i> failure of communication going on in this part, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":2093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","user":"Crumplepunch","date":". 04-29-2016, 10:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:42:26-07:00","id":877674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877665#post877665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't speak for anyone else, but it's hard for me not to over-analyse each new drip of information when the drips come so very slowly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bit chicken and egg, but communication isn't going to be more flowing until everything stops getting over analysed so making anyone doing it feel like they need to treat each forum post like an official corporate release.<br /> <br /> This is the fan forum, a bit of hyperbole by the Devs shouldn't be too hard to handle, right?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1181-molez","name":"Molez","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1181_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:46:17-07:00","id":877677,"title":"","content":"To begin with, the OP was not an Onyx Path press release, it was John posting because he is excited about the project. If you are new here, you might not realize that when John is excited he tends to post in a way that shares that excitement. (Although I am puzzled why anyone who has been around these forums for a few years would be surprised or put off by his posting style. John has posted like this for years.) So how about we lay off his posting style and reasonably discuss the content of what he posted, like whether the info excites you or causes concerns?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":28}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T07:47:51-07:00","id":877680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=877665#post877665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was the first one on this thread to express any not-joking reservations so I feel I should respond.<br /> <br /> Maybe this wasn't a problem of tone exactly, it was just that stressing the very (indeed, V-E-R-Y) high powered nature of the new Charms gives me unfortunate flashbacks to the blasted hellscape of 2.5 Solar power bloat that we just escaped for a merciful while.<br /> <br /> I don't think this was an entirely unfounded concern, because the Ink Monkey material by mister M\u00f8rke and others in the current team was a major contributor to said blasted hellscape. I really understand why you are frustrated with the forum response, and I can't speak for anyone else, but it's hard for me not to over-analyse each new drip of information when the drips come so very slowly.<br /> <br /> As for what could have been said instead, stressing that something is <i>fun </i>will get my enthusiasm going better than something being powerful every time.<br /> <br /> I have reasonable expectations that the new Charms will be just fine, but it's difficult to not be tense.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Valid points, granted, but also they've been assailed with &quot;God, everythings so weak now! GAH!&quot; and &quot;You never say anything to us!&quot;<br /> <br /> So they try to communicate outside of MMN's, blog posts and the like and with positivity for the platinum-after-four-days DTRPG product to assuage two of the fan-bases issues.<br /> <br /> Plus they were, aside from the 33 generously added Charms, from the fan-base who understandably might want high-powered Charms that are their little creations in print.<br /> <br /> I get people are tense after the long wait, get the core and then the next things high-powered etc. But also I think that all section of the fan base need to recognize that jumping on every post by the Devs, writers, Rich, OP - whoever - isn't a good thing. Those posts do come from someone sat the other end of the computer - maybe it was just a case of too much coffee or a particularly good day.<br /> <br /> I'm just happy that there's more Exalted stuff on the way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/907-jay","name":"Jay","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar907_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T08:13:31-07:00","id":877705,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar296_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"296\" data-vbnamecard=\"296\">hippokrene</a>, let me raise you...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ILK8GGH.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"fon