ng to offer a print on demand option. Then we might need to wait another week on top of however long we'd have been waiting for otherwise to check, and then a bit longer if color correction needs to happen. Otherwise, if it's uploading things to Drivethru it should be quite quick if they get the A-OK, but I think all these projects are likely to get some feedback from WWP on what ought to be changed. Generally what I tend to hear about trademark related works is that there tends to be a pretty heft guideline on making sure things are just right, so if anything it would likely be over minutia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11515-chaoticag","name":"Chaoticag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T17:15:53-07:00","id":898417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fata-Ku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/876347-exalted-returns-the-solar-backer-charm-pdf?p=898259#post898259\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love sail Charms and want there to be moar. I need those smuggling charms to become canon!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I won't lie, I saw &quot;Snuggling charms&quot; and imagined them as physical, but not really sex focused charms in Presence, or MAYBE Performance. &quot;Grand Snuggle of Peace and Joy&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /